  "result": {
    "text": "Promising medicines can wait on the work of clinical trials. Meet Protocol Pulse. Open a trial protocol. AI proposes clear source-linked rules. A clinical lead reviews and approves. Now screen thirty synthetic patients. Potential matches, conflicts, and missing evidence stay distinct. An order alone doesn't prove a medicine was taken. Confirm participation and the workflow keeps going. A new medication record arrives. Approved rules flag a conflict. AI investigates the evidence and drafts a cited summary. The clinical lead reviews the case and records the next step. Less repetitive work, more focused oversight. Protocol Pulse. Keep the trial moving. Bring tomorrow's medicines closer.",
    "language_code": "eng",
    "language_probability": 1,
